msgstr "目前支援的註冊商"

#: queue/intro.php:71
msgid "In order to use the Domain Queue you must setup the cron job that comes with %s."
msgstr "為了使用網域佇列，您必須設定 %s 附帶的 cron 作業。"

#: queue/intro.php:72
